  "question": "নিচের বণ্টনটির গড় কত?<br><br><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;width:100%;margin:10px 0;\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:420px;text-align:center;font-size:16px;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;background:#f2f2f2;\">প্রাপ্ত নম্বর</th><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">14</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">26</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">44</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">61</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">84</td></tr><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;background:#f2f2f2;\">শিক্ষার্থীর সংখ্যা</th><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">91</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">78</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">95</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">36</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:10px;\">98</td></tr></table></div>",
  "options": ["45", "46", "54", "69"],
  "answer": "45",
  "explanation": "বণ্টনের গড় = $\\frac{\\sum fx}{\\sum f}$<br><br>এখানে,<br>প্রাপ্ত নম্বর (x) = 14, 26, 44, 61, 84<br>শিক্ষার্থীর সংখ্যা (f) = 91, 78, 95, 36, 98<br><br>$\\sum f = 91 + 78 + 95 + 36 + 98 = 398$<br><br>$\\sum fx = (14 \\times 91) + (26 \\times 78) + (44 \\times 95) + (61 \\times 36) + (84 \\times 98)$<br>$= 1274 + 2028 + 4180 + 2196 + 8232$<br>$= 17910$<br><br>অতএব, গড় = $\\frac{17910}{398} = 45$।<br><br>সুতরাং সঠিক উত্তর = 45।"
